O.K. I found out the magic words were

setenv LC_ALL en_US.ISO8859-1  or
setenv LANG en_US.ISO8859-1

This replaces

setenv LC_CTYPE iso_8859_1

on SunOS4.1.3.

Now I can view euc Japanese. I still cannot view new-JIS like I can
on the Sun, but I guess that is tolerable.


