>         in one of our makefiles:
> 
> OPLIBS=-non_shared -lpthreads -lmach -lbsd -ldnet_stub -lc_r -lpthreads -lmach
[...bunch of stuff deleted...]

The 'cc(1)' command provides a '-threads' option that should do exactly
what you need for threads.  Get rid of all the threads, mach, and lc_r
stuff
from your link line and use -threads, i.e. something like this:

OPLIBS=-non_shared -threads -lbsd -ldnet_stub

