|>Our Alpha 2100 (model 4/275) running OSF/1 ver.3.0 has a high
|>number of users login to it concurrently. Besides changing the 
|>kernel and creating the ttys , i doubt if the No. of Units in the
|>OSF-USR Pak need to be increased. If so, how my units are required
|>, say to cater for concurrent logins of 300
|>(Is there any formula to calculate it ?) 
|>
|>The PAK we are using now is as follows:
|>
|>           Product Name: OSF-USR
|>               Producer: DEC
|>                 Issuer: DEC
|>   Authorization Number: ALN-PA-95179-808
|>        Number of units: 1500
