|>   Product Release Date: 
|>   Key Termination Date: 21-AUG-1996
|>Availability Table Code: H
|>    Activity Table Code: 
|>            Key Options: MOD_UNITS, ALPHA
|>          Product Token: 
|>

I don't know what the formula might be but the number of units consumed by 
a user varies based on the platform type.  As root, execute 'lmf list'.

Look for the OSF-USR listing in the output.  It will show the limit of users
allowed and the currently active users.  You can then figure out what you need
to change the units to.  For example, if 1500 units gave you 15 users, 3000
should give you 30.


