|>Hello,
|>
|>    I'm responsible for an alpha 2100 5/250 server and I want to
|>do a custom installation of DU 4.0. One problem, the installation
|>software has identified the VGA monitor hooked up to the system as
|>graphics capability and brings up the installation in GUI mode.
|>The video that is produced is unreadable (a very fuzzy and dim display
|>of four copies of a window across the screen). Does anyone know
|>of a way to force a text-base install??
|>
