Hi,

We are currently running Sybase on OpenVMS and we are becoming quite
dissatisfied with this for various reasons including:

*	time to market on new products and bug fixes.  
*	3rd party product availability
*	quality of support
*	ease of administration

We are currently considering moving to Digital UNIX.  This is our
prefered solution as we also have a heavy investment in Alpha's.  

What we realy need to know though, is that we won't be facing the same
problems.  

Could anyone running Sybase of Digital UNIX please get in touch with me
either by E-mail or phone any let me know of your experiences ?  I am
hoping they are good ones, however if you have had problems I would like
to know these as well. 

If you have moved from VMS, or have always been on Digital UNIX I would
like to hear from you.

Thanks for any help you can give me.


