Steffen,

This is an older version of Ladebug.  A lot of work has gone into
improving the thread support since 3.0-16.  

If you are running Digital Unix 3.2, you can upgrade to 4.0-14.
However, due to incompatible changes in the operating system thread
support, this is the latest debugger with thread support on 3.2 that
we provide.

If you are running Digital Unix 4.0, then you have a copy of 4.0-19
(or later) on the system.  This has even better thread support - but
you have to upgrade the operating system to get it.
